{"id":"6be0fd6df8f81383","group":"91","path":"91/91-prop-truth-predicate-function.md","title":"真理谓词的语法扩展与公理功能","display":"prop-truth-predicate-function — 真理谓词的语法扩展与公理功能","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-prop-truth-predicate-function","aliases":["91-prop-truth-predicate-function","91-prop-truth-predicate-role","91-predicate-utility"],"display":"prop-truth-predicate-function — 真理谓词的语法扩展与公理功能","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","[[91-df-quantifier-axiom]]","[[91-df-reflection-principle]]","[[91-df-substitution-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-prop-truth-predicate-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-prop-truth-predicate-function</span><span>91-prop-truth-predicate-role</span><span>91-predicate-utility</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-truth-predicate-function — 真理谓词的语法扩展与公理功能"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"580e312553b05c39\" href=\"?note=580e312553b05c39\" title=\"91-df-quantifier-axiom\">91-df-quantifier-axiom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fa1e29f5683a4d6f\" href=\"?note=fa1e29f5683a4d6f\" title=\"91-df-reflection-principle\">91-df-reflection-principle</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"95643c507a4d6dc3\" href=\"?note=95643c507a4d6dc3\" title=\"91-df-substitution-function\">91-df-substitution-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T=\\mathcal L_0\\cup\\{T\\}\">\\(\\mathcal L_T=\\mathcal L_0\\cup\\{T\\}\\)</span> (加入新一元谓词的语言扩展)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal S\\)</span> (该语言中的理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QComp}(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\operatorname{QComp}(\\mathcal S)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal S\\)</span> 含适当的量词组合公理)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TRefl}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\operatorname{TRefl}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\mathcal S)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal S\\)</span> 含 PA 的真理反思)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_x\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_x\\)</span> (数码代入函数)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\\)</span> (PA 的标准可证性谓词)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\mathcal L_0\\subsetneq\\mathcal L_T,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\mathcal L_0\\subsetneq\\mathcal L_T,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QComp}(\\mathcal S)\n\\to\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall n\\,\nT\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Sub}_x(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},n)\n\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{QComp}(\\mathcal S)\n\\to\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall n\\,\nT\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Sub}_x(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},n)\n\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TRefl}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\mathcal S)\n\\to\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\forall x\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\\to T(x)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TRefl}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\mathcal S)\n\\to\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\forall x\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\\to T(x)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一式只是语法事实。量词概括和可证性反思分别来自额外的组合公理与\n反思原则，不是新增符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的逻辑后果。特别地，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> 本来就能在纯算术语言表达；真理谓词的作用不是让这个\n句子首次“可写”，而是可能为反思证明提供统一中介。</p>\n<p>因此比较真理与可证性时，应分别说明可定义性、概括能力、语义充分性和\n所选理论的证明强度，不能仅按谓词名称排序。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-quantifier-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"580e312553b05c39","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-quantifier-axiom]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-reflection-principle","status":"resolved","id":"fa1e29f5683a4d6f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-reflection-principle]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-substitution-function","status":"resolved","id":"95643c507a4d6dc3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-substitution-function]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T=\\mathcal L_0\\cup\\{T\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{QComp}(\\mathcal S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TRefl}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\mathcal S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_x","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\mathcal L_0\\subsetneq\\mathcal L_T,","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{QComp}(\\mathcal S)\n\\to\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall n\\,\nT\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Sub}_x(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},n)\n\\bigr),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TRefl}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\mathcal S)\n\\to\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\forall x\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\\to T(x)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false}],"bytes":1968,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["0838e653809dc677","580e312553b05c39","fa1e29f5683a4d6f","95643c507a4d6dc3"]}